ions<\/li><li>Camps<\/li><\/ul><a href=''https://www.abusepreventionsystems.com/churchmutual/'' rel=''noopener noreferrer'' target=''_blank''>Click here<\/a> to learn more about APS.<\/p><br><h3>How do I get started?<\/h3><ol><li>Sign up for an annual membership.<\/li><li>Gain access to online tools and resources.<\/li><li>Browse selection of online trainings and find the best fit for your staff and volunteers.<\/li><li>Deploy and manage trainings.<\/li><\/ol><\/p>","config":{}},"info-call-to-action-text":{"defaultValue":"<div class=''card-deck pt-6 pb-7''><div class=''call-to-action-card card''><img src=''/o/cmic-fragment-collection-contributor/images/logo/logo-ministrysafe-3.png'' alt=''logo'' class=''card-img-top''><h3 class=''font-weight-bold''>Sign up with MinistrySafe today!<\/h3><a href=''https://ministrysafe.com/churchmutual'' target=''_blank'' role=''button'' class=''mx-3 my-5 btn btn-outline-primary link-action''>MORE INFO<\/a><\/div><div><\/div><div class=''call-to-action-card card''><img src=''/o/cmic-fragment-collection-contributor/images/logo/logo-ministrysafe-4.png'' class=''card-img-top'' alt=''logo''><h3 class=''font-weight-bold''>Sign up with Abuse Prevention Systems today!<\/h3><a href=''https://www.abusepreventionsystems.com/churchmutual'' target=''_blank'' role=''button'' class=''mx-3 my-5 btn btn-outline-primary link-action''>MORE INFO<\/a><\/div><\/div>","config":{}}},"com.liferay.fragment.entry.processor.freemarker.FreeMarkerFragmentEntryProcessor":{}}', N'siis', 0, NULL, CAST(N'2024-06-17T19:06:39.2390000' AS DateTime2), NULL)
